%% Sequence/Flow Diagrams (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as 사용자
  participant UI as 샘플 UI(main.js)
  participant AD as Adapter(bp-adapter.js)
  participant API as AdApi(api.js)
  participant BP as Bright Pattern 테넌트

  U->>UI: 페이지 열기
  UI->>AD: initAdApi({domain, standalone, mountRoot})
  AD->>API: new AdApi(...)
  API-->>UI: ON_READY (또는 폴링으로 준비 확인)
  UI->>AD: waitForReady()
  UI->>API: getLoginState()
  API-->>UI: isLoggedIn? (기존 세션 채택)

  U->>UI: 로그인 클릭(username/password/tenant)
  UI->>API: login(...)
  API-->>UI: ON_LOGIN
  UI->>API: getAgentNotReadyReasons()
  UI->>API: getAgentState()

  U->>UI: 채팅 시작
  UI->>API: setService(serviceId)
  UI->>API: startChat("web")
  API-->>UI: ON_NEW_INTERACTION (chat)
  U->>UI: 메시지 전송
  UI->>API: sendChatMessage(text)
  API-->>UI: ON_INTERACTION_STATE_CHANGE (messages)

  U->>UI: 통화 시작
  UI->>API: startCall(number)
  API-->>UI: ON_NEW_INTERACTION (call)
  U->>UI: 음소거/보류/DTMF
  UI->>API: setCallMute/ setCallHold/ sendDtmf

  U->>UI: 위젯 최소화
  UI->>API: setWidgetMinimized(true)
  API-->>UI: ON_WIDGET_MINIMIZED_CHANGE
